    <p class="text-lg text-[var(--tx-2)] max-w-xl mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Security engineer with deep expertise in offensive security and application security.
      Documenting pentesting techniques, vulnerability research, and real-world exploit chains.
    </p>

    <!-- CTA row -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
